     1,
     "<div>Dear group,</div><div> </div><div>As a follow-up, here is a reproducible example (Kohske&#39;s code - thanks Dennis).</div><div> </div><div><span>library</span><span>(</span><span>ggplot2</span><span>)</span><span>\n</span></div><div><span>df </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> data</span><span>.</span><span>frame</span><span>(</span><span>x </span><span>=</span><span> rep</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>:</span><span>100</span><span>,</span><span> times</span><span>=</span><span>7</span><span>),</span><span>\n        facet_var </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>as</span><span>.</span><span>factor</span><span>(</span><span>rep</span><span>(</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span>:</span><span>7</span><span>,</span><span> each</span><span>=</span><span>100</span><span>)),</span><span>\n        y </span><span>=</span><span> runif</span><span>(</span><span>7</span><span>*</span><span>100</span><span>)</span><span>\n      </span><span>)</span><span> \n\n</span></div><div><span></span><span></span> </div><div><span># label for marginal plot</span><span>\n</span></div><div><span>df </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> rbind</span><span>(</span><span>df</span><span>,</span><span> data</span><span>.</span><span>frame</span><span>(</span><span>x </span><span>=</span><span> NA</span><span>,</span><span> y </span><span>=</span><span> NA</span><span>,</span><span> facet_var </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;Boxplot wow&quot;</span><span>))</span><span>\n\n</span></div><div><span>p </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> ggplot</span><span>(</span><span>data </span><span>=</span><span> df</span><span>,</span><span> aes</span><span>(</span><span>x</span><span>,</span><span> y</span><span>))</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span>\n    geom_line</span><span>()</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> facet_wrap</span><span>(</span><span> </span><span>~</span><span> facet_var</span><span>,</span><span> ncol</span><span>=</span><span>2</span><span>)</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> \n    </span></div><div><span># set limits for adjustment</span><span>\n    </span></div><div><span>coord_cartesian</span><span>(</span><span>xlim </span><span>=</span><span> c</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>100</span><span>))</span><span>\n\n</span></div><div><span></span> </div><div><span>xdata </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> runif</span><span>(</span><span>1000</span><span>,</span><span> min </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>20</span><span>,</span><span> max </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>80</span><span>)</span><span>\n</span></div><div><span>boxdf </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> data</span><span>.</span><span>frame</span><span>(</span><span>x</span><span>=</span><span>xdata</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>group</span><span>=</span><span>rep</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>,</span><span>length</span><span>(</span><span>xdata</span><span>)))</span><span>\n\n</span></div><div><span>q </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> ggplot</span><span>(</span><span>data </span><span>=</span><span> boxdf</span><span>,</span><span> aes</span><span>(</span><span>as</span><span>.</span><span>factor</span><span>(</span><span>group</span><span>),</span><span>x</span><span>))</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> geom_boxplot</span><span>()</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span>\n\n    </span></div><div><span># set breaks and limits for adjustment</span><span>\n    </span></div><div><span>coord_flip</span><span>(</span><span>ylim </span><span>=</span><span> c</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>100</span><span>))</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> labs</span><span>(</span><span>x</span><span>=</span><span>NULL</span><span>)</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> \n    scale_y_continuous</span><span>(</span><span>breaks </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span>:</span><span>5</span><span>*</span><span>20</span><span>)</span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> \n\n    </span></div><div><span>#</span><span>opts for full region drawing: </span><span>\n    </span><span></span></div><div><span># see <a href=\"https://kohske.wordpress.com/2010/12/25/drawing-on-full-region-in-ggplot2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kohske.wordpress.com/2010/12/25/drawing-on-full-region-in-ggplot2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372894682000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RneSdoaZt6Cn0gqEyYbZE\">https://kohske.wordpress.com/2010/12/25/drawing-on-full-region-in-ggplot2/</a></span><span>\n    </span></div><div><span>opts</span><span>(</span><span>\n    legend</span><span>.</span><span>position </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;none&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\n    panel</span><span>.</span><span>margin </span><span>=</span><span> unit</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span>&quot;null&quot;</span><span>),</span><span>\n    plot</span><span>.</span><span>margin </span><span>=</span><span> rep</span><span>(</span><span>unit</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span>&quot;null&quot;</span><span>),</span><span>4</span><span>),</span><span>\n    axis</span><span>.</span><span>ticks </span><span>=</span><span> theme_blank</span><span>(),</span><span>\n    axis</span><span>.</span><span>text</span><span>.</span><span>x </span><span>=</span><span> theme_blank</span><span>(),</span><span>\n    axis</span><span>.</span><span>text</span><span>.</span><span>y </span><span>=</span><span> theme_blank</span><span>(),</span><span>\n    axis</span><span>.</span><span>title</span><span>.</span><span>x </span><span>=</span><span> theme_blank</span><span>(),</span><span>\n    axis</span><span>.</span><span>title</span><span>.</span><span>y </span><span>=</span><span> theme_blank</span><span>(),</span><span>\n    axis</span><span>.</span><span>ticks</span><span>.</span><span>length </span><span>=</span><span> unit</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span>&quot;null&quot;</span><span>),</span><span>\n    axis</span><span>.</span><span>ticks</span><span>.</span><span>margin </span><span>=</span><span> unit</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span>&quot;null&quot;</span><span>)</span><span>\n  </span><span>)</span><span>\n\n</span><span></span></div><div><span></span> </div><div><span>print</span><span>(</span><span>p</span><span>)</span><span>\n\n</span></div><div><span></span><span># remove unused panel</span><span>\n</span></div><div><span>grid</span><span>.</span><span>remove</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;panel-14-5&quot;</span><span>)</span><span>\n\n</span></div><div><span>downViewport</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;panel-14-5&quot;</span><span>)</span><span>\n</span></div><div><span></span><span>print</span><span>(</span><span>q</span><span>,</span><span> newpage</span><span>=</span><span>F</span><span>)</span></div><div> </div><div>It is the three bottom lines that do not work with R version 2.15.2 with ggplot2_0.9.3.  I have replaced them with </div><div><span>grid.remove(&quot;panel-8.16-7-16-7&quot;)</span></div><div><span><span>downViewport(&quot;panel-8.16-7-16-7&quot;)</span></span></div><div><span><span></span></span> </div><div><span><span>but then I get the error</span></span></div>"
